        "t": 345.434912,
        "r": 527.1628499999991,
        "b": 302.5432889281767
      },
      "content": "Read and observe instructions of the name plate on the machine. Also, do not change the position of the name plate or damage it. If broken, purchase it with the no. of item shown in Part List.",
